{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["פרו — in pregnancy." "וישרצו — birth. That the womb did not miscarry. For everywhere small creatures are called שרץ על הארץ." "וירבו — they grew; the small ones became big and did not die in their youth." "ויעצמו — that people did not die, but they were many and multiplied exceedingly, until the land was filled with them. And likewise: ״והחצר מלאה את נוגה כבוד ה׳״ — like מילאה. And likewise: ״ושוליו מלאים את ההיכל״ — like ממלאים את ההיכל."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:40:07.724446485Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}